(7694695, 1261514, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great contre-jour, I see silhouette, I see shadow, I see depth, I see reflection, I see lens flare, it all adds to the image. Nice low vantage point. I would crop away the sign on the left.</td>', 'Great contre-jour, I see silhouette, I see shadow, I see depth, I see reflection, I see lens flare, it all adds to the image. Nice low vantage point. I would crop away the sign on the left.', '2021-05-21 16:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
